  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given that<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></msup></math></p><p>Differentiating on both sides</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></msup><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>18</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>18</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></msup><mo>.</mo><mfrac><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mn>18</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>36</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>54</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></msup><mo>.</mo><mfrac><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mn>18</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>48</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>28</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>34</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Here&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is not defined at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo></math>is not differentiable at two points.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"
